.SH "نام (NAME)"
mksubvolume \- Command\-line program to create btrfs subvolume
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBmksubvolume\fR\ 'u
\fBmksubvolume\fR [\-\-nocow] [\-\-verbose] {\fIpath\fR}
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
Mksubvolume is a command\-line program to create a btrfs subvolume including adding a fstab entry and mounting the subvolume at the absolute path
\fIpath\fR\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\-\-nocow\fR
.RS 4
Set the no\-copy\-on\-write flag for the subvolume\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-v, \-\-verbose\fR
.RS 4
Increase verbosity\&.
.RE
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP
Arvin Schnell
<aschnell@suse\&.com>
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
\fBsnapper\fR(5),
\fBbtrfs\fR(8),
\fBfstab\fR(5),
\fBmount\fR(8)
